{"id":"z81-09","volume":81,"volumeTitle":"晋纪三","volumeSubtitle":"","index":9,"title":{"t":"太康九年","s":"太康九年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"晋紀三 · 戊申","s":"晋纪三 · 戊申"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"春季正月壬申初一，发生日食。","tokens":[{"t":"春","s":"春","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"正","s":"正","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"壬","s":"壬","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"申","s":"申","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"朔","s":"朔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"日","s":"日","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"有","s":"有","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"食","s":"食","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"夏季六月庚子初一，发生日食。","tokens":[{"t":"夏","s":"夏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"六","s":"六","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"庚","s":"庚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"朔","s":"朔","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"日","s":"日","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"有","s":"有","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"食","s":"食","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"三十三个郡国大旱。","tokens":[{"t":"郡","s":"郡","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"三","s":"三","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"十","s":"十","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"三","s":"三","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"旱","s":"旱","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"秋季八月壬子日，流星像雨一样坠落。","tokens":[{"t":"秋","s":"秋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"八","s":"八","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"月","s":"月","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"壬","s":"壬","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"子","s":"子","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"；","s":"；","punct":true},{"t":"星","s":"星","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"隕","s":"陨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"如","s":"如","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"雨","s":"雨","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"发生地震。","tokens":[{"t":"地","s":"地","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"震","s":"震","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"太康九年正月初一和六月初一都发生日食。三十三个郡国大旱。八月壬子，流星坠落如雨。同时又发生地震。这一年没有诏令、任免和边事，只记天象和灾害。日食一年两次，都写在朔日。旱灾给出郡国的数目，不列地名。星陨和地震分成两句，紧接在八月之后。","theme":"太康的最后一年，正文只剩下日食、大旱、星陨和地震。平吴以后的封赏、骨肉和撤兵都不再出现。灾害的数目是三十三郡国，地震没有地点。读的时候接在太庙改建和匈奴来降之后，这一年不再解释原因。","technique":"五句都短。两次日食重复「朔，日有食之」，只换月份。大旱用郡国数。星陨如雨保留原文的比喻。地震单独成句，不加占验。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"地震","reading":"dì zhèn","note":"八月星陨之后单独记了一笔。「地震」。"},{"word":"大旱","reading":"dà hàn","note":"三十三个郡国同时大旱。「郡国三十三大旱」。"},{"word":"星陨","reading":"xīng yǔn","note":"流星坠落。「星陨如雨」。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"之","reading":"zhī","note":"它，指太阳。「日有食之」。"}],"ancientModern":[],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"如","note":"像。「星陨如雨」。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"日食句式","note":"「某月朔，日有食之」是记日食的固定句，一年里用了两次。"}]}}
